  "description": "Extensions for Umbraco Flavoured Markdown (Ufm). Adds contentTypeName and contentTypeAlias components, and injects $contentTypeName / $contentTypeAlias into the UfmJS scope so block labels can fall back to the content type — restoring V13-style { title || $contentTypeName } expressions in Umbraco v16 and v17+. Supports Umbraco 16 (.NET 9) and Umbraco 17 (.NET 10).",
